@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-88886
+notes:
+  core_backup:
+    - message: >-
+        The backup `file_logger` now serializes only the file name (a path
+        relative to `$CFG->backuptempdir`) when the log file lives inside the
+        backup temp directory, and rebuilds the full path on wakeup using the
+        current `$CFG->backuptempdir`. Loggers pointing outside that directory
+        (e.g. `$CFG->backup_file_logger_extra`) keep storing the full path.
+        Previously serialized loggers holding absolute or relative paths are
+        still supported. New `get_fullpath()` and `get_relativepath()`
+        accessors have been added.
+      type: changed
